{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26645","headline":"寄汴州令狐楚相公 · 姚合","name":"寄汴州令狐楚相公","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"汴水从今不复浑，秋风鼙鼓动城根。\n梁园台馆关东少，相府旌旗天下尊。\n诗好四方谁敢和，政成三郡自无冤。\n几时诏下归丹阙，还领千官入合门。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"姚合","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_26645.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26645","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}